; bfsodium KECCAK ABSORB 168 : one block into the state  and one permutation
;
; NOTE square brackets are brainfuck loops  so comments use braces for counts;
;
; HAND WRITTEN; idiom/xor64 is PASTED 21 times and keccak/permute1600 once;
; This was the middle of keccak/sponge168 until ParallelHash needed to drive
; an absorb itself  and it is the same code in the same cells;
;
; INTERFACE entry=367 exit=0 footprint=0:1037
; IO  in:  S{200}  block{168}          (368 bytes  contiguous)
;     out: S{200}  the state after the block and the permutation
;
; S := PERMUTE( S xor block )  which is one turn of FIPS 202 section 4's absorb;
; The caller owns the padding and owns deciding when a block is full; all this
; does is take one;
;
; THE RATE IS 168 AND THAT IS EXACTLY 21 LANES  so a block is 21
; entries of xor64 rather than 168 byte exclusive ors; Every rate in the
; family divides by eight the same way;
;
; AND EVERY OPERAND IS MOVED  never copied: the state lane is replaced by the
; answer and the block is SPENT  so the caller gets an empty block back and
; needs no clear of its own;
;
; THE BLOCK IS READ LOW AND STAGED HIGH  because it cannot sit under the
; permutation's own frame at 200 to 816; It is read at 200 and moved to 824
; where the sponge always kept it; A PASTED caller has already put it at 824
; and the move then walks noughts  which is one test per cell;
;
; AND THE PROLOGUE IS CONTIGUOUS ON PURPOSE; reading straight into 824 would
; need a run of six hundred steps in the prologue  and bfexpand's body() only
; skips prologue lines that contain a comma  so a run that long wraps onto
; lines it then pastes into every caller; That was a real defect for one
; afternoon and the contract at ptr=367 is what caught it;
;
; TAPE MAP  (home @0)
;   @0x000:0x0c7  S{200}  the sponge state
;   @0x0c8:0x330  keccak/permute1600's frame  pasted at this file's own zero
;   @0x338:0x3df  block{168} one rate of message; SPENT into the state
;   @0x3e8:0x40d  the exclusive or frame; xor64 pasted at @0x3e8

; read the state and then the block  the two of them contiguous
  ,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,>,
; ASSERT ptr=367
; the block is STAGED high  clear of the permutation's own frame;
; a PASTED caller has already put it there and the run below moves
; noughts  which costs one test per cell and is the price of one
; read prologue serving both a standalone run and a paste
